 summary="Japanese forces used Okinawa's natural limestone caves (gama) and dug tunnels for command posts, hospitals and shelters; civilians hid in them too.",
 steps=["Natural caves were enlarged and linked.","The underground Navy Headquarters was dug with pickaxes.","Field hospitals operated in caves."],
