 steps=["Tuff, soft to carve but hardening in air, was dug with hand tools.","Ventilation shafts brought air to the deepest levels and supplied water.","Stables, wine presses, chapels, kitchens and schools were carved.","Rolling stone doors, 1 m wide, could be closed from inside only."],
